 "notes": "All five planned kinds kept. Schleicher skew trimmed: AS 33 kept as flat model; Schleicher self-launchers (ASK 21 Mi, ASH 31 Mi, ASG 32 Mi, AS 34 Me, AS 35 Mi) kept as flat models in Motor-glider for lack of retrieved pages. Old Discus-2/Duo Discus/Ventus/Arcus/ASK 21/ASW 28 became archetypes; Taurus, S10 became archetypes; A-425 recorded as A-425lw per Cameron's A-type page; Z-90 under Ultramagic Z-series; GB1000 archetype. Left out: Cameron O-type archetype (only a search snippet; O-31 kept flat), Lindstrand models (no range page; brand stub only), Stemme S12 details, Nimbus-3/4 years, Ventus 3 year, Skyacht personal blimp and Gefa-Flug airships (no model details), Goodyear blimps (corporate). Founding years left blank where pages did not give them."
